   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Of course it works! I told you it would. See, you just had to believe.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-891057272": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Don’t celebrate yet. I still have to ask… is this right? Selling human milk like it’s a normal product?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-849990055": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -560813249,
    509247152,
    1638313128,
    -1514551683
   ],
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "So what? If it makes them happy and it keeps the farm alive, who cares what they do with it?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
